    "content": "If 93,000 seeds were generated via COLDCARD, there’s a 50% chance two people would generate the same 24 word phrase / wallet\n\nWith proper entropy, a 24-word seed phrase has 256 bits of randomness \n\n(2^256 possible seeds, about 1.16 × 10^77).\n\nThat’s 400 undecillion wallets\n 400,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000,000.\n\nIf all 8 billion humans generated a billion seeds per second, it would take about 1.6 trillion years to reach 50% collision odds.",
